    "body": "I think we should strive to use the https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-replace-all primitive here, which would take care of most of the work, preceded by a call to https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#converting-nodes-into-a-node.\r\n\r\nAnd I guess we need to run https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-ensure-pre-insertion-validity as well.",
